4em 0.6em}.mw-parser-output .infobox.geography .maptable td,.mw-parser-output .infobox.geography .maptable th{border:0;padding:0}</style><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"border-spacing:3px; width:30em;\"><caption class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan\" title=\"Damallsvenskan\">Damallsvenskan</a></caption><tbody><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollss%C3%A4song\" title=\"Fotbollssäsong\">Säsong</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">2016</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Nya lag för säsongen</span></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Dam\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Dam\">Djurgårdens IF</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Kvarnsvedens_IK\" title=\"Kvarnsvedens IK\">Kvarnsvedens IK</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Vinnare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköpings FC</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Nedflyttade</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5_IK_FF\" title=\"Umeå IK FF\">Umeå IK</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Mallbackens_IF\" title=\"Mallbackens IF\">Mallbackens IF</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uefa_Women%27s_Champions_League_2017/2018\" title=\"Uefa Women&#39;s Champions League 2017/2018\">Champions League</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköpings FC</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f2;\">Statistik</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Spelade&#160;matcher</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">132</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Totalt&#160;antal&#160;mål</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">404 (3,1 per match)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Bästa målgörare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pernille_Harder\" title=\"Pernille Harder\">Pernille Harder</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköping</a> (23 mål)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköping</a> 8–0 <a href=\"/wiki/Vittsj%C3%B6_GIK\" title=\"Vittsjö GIK\">Vittsjö</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(15 juni 2016)</span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköping</a> 8–0 <a href=\"/wiki/Kvarnsvedens_IK\" title=\"Kvarnsvedens IK\">Kvarnsveden</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(2 september 2016)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mallbackens_IF\" title=\"Mallbackens IF\">Mallbacken</a> 0–6 <a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">Rosengård</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(8 maj 2016)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Flest mål i en match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköping</a> 8–0 <a href=\"/wiki/Vittsj%C3%B6_GIK\" title=\"Vittsjö GIK\">Vittsjö</a